    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The bots are playing Basket Ball. They dont have hands. They are fine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Master the physic !</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump, Dash or Roll to bounce the ball and score.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3725900/extras/88c79c8a8a66a9b3ca23c4c642642181.poster.avif?t=1755186268\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3725900/extras/88c79c8a8a66a9b3ca23c4c642642181.webm?t=1755186268\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3725900/extras/88c79c8a8a66a9b3ca23c4c642642181.mp4?t=1755186268\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collect pickups to change the game !</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Faster</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bigger</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Extra ball</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dash refill</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The ground is lava</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bomb</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Score 3 points !</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3725900/extras/342738c4de1e49134c3127647455df76.poster.avif?t=1755186268\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3725900/extras/342738c4de1e49134c3127647455df76.webm?t=1755186268\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3725900/extras/342738c4de1e49134c3127647455df76.mp4?t=1755186268\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play locally versus a bot or a human</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Using a controller is recommended, but keyboard input is working.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The bots are playing Basket Ball. They dont have hands. They are fine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Master the physic !</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump, Dash or Roll to bounce the ball and score.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3725900/extras/88c79c8a8a66a9b3ca23c4c642642181.poster.avif?t=1755186268\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3725900/extras/88c79c8a8a66a9b3ca23c4c642642181.webm?t=1755186268\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3725900/extras/88c79c8a8a66a9b3ca23c4c642642181.mp4?t=1755186268\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collect pickups to change the game !</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Faster</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bigger</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Extra ball</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dash refill</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The ground is lava</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bomb</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Score 3 points !</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3725900/extras/342738c4de1e49134c3127647455df76.poster.avif?t=1755186268\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3725900/extras/342738c4de1e49134c3127647455df76.webm?t=1755186268\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3725900/extras/342738c4de1e49134c3127647455df76.mp4?t=1755186268\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play locally versus a bot or a human</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Using a controller is recommended, but keyboard input is working.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
